[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11461.11, "timestamp": "03:11:01", "text": "我意识到每当我玩游戏时，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11463.429, "timestamp": "03:11:03", "text": "更专注等等。它不会说话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11466.469, "timestamp": "03:11:06", "text": "很多。嗯哼。我觉得自己很差劲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11469.11, "timestamp": "03:11:09", "text": "只是闲聊或说话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11471.67, "timestamp": "03:11:11", "text": "流的类型。随着时间的推移，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11473.99, "timestamp": "03:11:13", "text": "我意识到自己有能力适应，而且我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11477.83, "timestamp": "03:11:17", "text": "能够做到。通过贾达，我意识到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11480.87, "timestamp": "03:11:20", "text": "对于大多数人来说，我一直决定……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11483.11, "timestamp": "03:11:23", "text": "比赛中，我们有过几次这样的时刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11485.03, "timestamp": "03:11:25", "text": "甚至都不需要玩游戏。我们当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11487.91, "timestamp": "03:11:27", "text": "擦拭和冷藏的次数很多，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11491.429, "timestamp": "03:11:31", "text": "是的。是的。时光飞逝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11493.11, "timestamp": "03:11:33", "text": "然后你就一脸懵逼：“啊？”所以，关于那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11498.07, "timestamp": "03:11:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11500.389, "timestamp": "03:11:40", "text": "是的。就像我理解的那样，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11501.99, "timestamp": "03:11:41", "text": "稍微难一点，但要做到这一点就有点困难了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11504.309, "timestamp": "03:11:44", "text": "就像促膝长谈一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11506.309, "timestamp": "03:11:46", "text": "对话或者，你知道，付费"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11508.309, "timestamp": "03:11:48", "text": "当你试图集中注意力时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11510.79, "timestamp": "03:11:50", "text": "在游戏中生存下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11512.55, "timestamp": "03:11:52", "text": "是的。但这并非一件坏事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11514.469, "timestamp": "03:11:54", "text": "任何一个。游戏似乎也提供了一种……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11516.15, "timestamp": "03:11:56", "text": "有机会给你喜欢的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11518.07, "timestamp": "03:11:58", "text": "也谈谈这个吧？"}]